{"_id":"69712e0203b48b900bf6dcea","roadmapSlug":"mlops","nodeId":"YmRN43yAFF97c7MgNaiqs","description":"# Grafana\n\nGrafana is an open-source data visualization and monitoring tool. It allows users to query, visualize, alert on, and explore metrics, logs, and traces. Grafana connects to various data sources, such as Prometheus, Graphite, Elasticsearch, and InfluxDB, to create customizable dashboards that display real-time data and historical trends.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Grafana","url":"https://grafana.com/","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa614"},{"type":"official","title":"Grafana Docs","url":"https://grafana.com/docs/","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa615"},{"type":"official","title":"Grafana Webinars and Videos","url":"https://grafana.com/videos/","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa616"},{"type":"article","title":"What is Grafana?","url":"https://www.redhat.com/en/topics/data-services/what-is-grafana","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa617"},{"type":"video","title":"Grafana Explained in Under 5 Minutes ΓÅ▓","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lILY8eSspEo","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa618"},{"type":"video","title":"Grafana for Beginners Ep. 1","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TQur9GJHIIQ&list=PLDGkOdUX1Ujo27m6qiTPPCpFHVfyKq9jT","_id":"6a7f4ad3cb44947debcfa619"}],"createdAt":"2026-01-21T19:50:26.485Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-14T17:05:22.994Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e04dcfb5fcb94d04168aa","title":"DataCamp - MLOps Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/L0Ynzo"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/mlops/content/YmRN43yAFF97c7MgNaiqs.md"}